{"id":"n62318-2-5","stage":0,"title":"그만두다 · 罢休","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62318-2-5-1","ko":"재미있는 영화가 하나도 없네.","zh":"一点有趣的电影都没有啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"재미있는","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있는","audio":"/audio/f963495a3d81a4c95b50.mp3"}},{"text":"영화가","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화가","audio":"/audio/71d36dbc5cb7f78071bd.mp3"}},{"text":"하나도","meaning":"完全","explanation":"하나：完全；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20283","senseId":"4","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나도","audio":"/audio/11c4172e3e9554b54380.mp3"}},{"text":"없네.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없네","audio":"/audio/40299a69ec2e93a5e2b3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"完全","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20283","definition":"全然，毫无。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"8